:"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aH3xlewNKQk5K4mEko6qQQ","review_id":"rN8wV5HYtFXIWjKM48OV1A","date":"2013-11-11T02:12:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9483035802841187,"text_excerpt":"I won't bother getting into the whole \"is Midway Pizza really deep dish?\" or \"Midway pizza isn't Chicago-style pizza\" debates. Personally, neither of those really matters to me. What matters, is GOOD PIZZA! Two friends and I swung by this joint one evening for dinner. Parking was easy; score! The door was opened for us, we were greeted and quickly seated. Our server came by for drink orders, gave us time to look over the menu (we needed it... lots of it... no one could decide on what to get cuz it all sounded so DEELISH), and he answered our questions so that we could ultimately (finally!) decide on pizzas. Great service in my book! I chose the FD2: chorizo sausage, green chiles, red onio..."},{"business_id":"aH3xlewNKQk5K4mEko6qQQ","review_id":"0YkxGfPIZrxt-WDJjZdczA","date":"2020-09-02T03:40:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9455392360687256,"text_excerpt":"We finally made the trek (13 minute drive ) to this pizza spot for some of their renowned deep dish pizza. It was so worth it. Ambiance is casual and eclectic-typical if a pizza place. Service was on point-so attentive. Onto the food: we started with the large baby spinach salad and large Zeus' place salad. Holy moly these salads were MASSIVE and had SO many legit goodies!! Baby spinach cake with Gorgonzola crumbles, candied pecans, sliced boiled egg, and a TON of bacon! The Zeus plate was a light and super flavorful Mediterranean salad with lots of fresh goodies-tomatoes, artichokes, olives, feta. Pizza: the deep dish was so hearty, yummy and wholesome. We tried the Kingpen (meatballs), ..."},{"business_id":"aH3xlewNKQk5K4mEko6qQQ","review_id":"0j1eXKKoe_5nUikea43rSw","date":"2021-06-23T13:51:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9437170028686523,"text_excerpt":"As a lover of thick-crust pizza, I feel a little like a motherless child here in New Orleans where New York style rules the day. Fortunately today I found a home at Midway Pizza. I'm not from Chicago so I can't attest to the authenticity of their pizza; all I know is, I loved it. Two of us split a small half Joehead/half Thunderbird. It was just enough for lunch (leaving room for a Sno-Bliz after) and I couldn't say which one was better. The crust was perfectly baked, with just the right amount of sauce. They have a good selection of wines and beers, including my favorite Gnarley Barley. Our server was very nice and helpful, and I don't think it took the 25 minutes they warn you about for..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aH3xlewNKQk5K4mEko6qQQ","photo_id":"FtDCsIIW33IuVcdEQnnaNw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/FtDCsIIW33IuVcdEQnnaNw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9024322628974915},{"business_id":"aH3xlewNKQk5K4mEko6qQQ","photo_id":"bOYqy60sPWQ8DX9CT4ozKQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bOYqy60sPWQ8DX9CT4ozKQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8821521997451782},{"business_id":"aH3xlewNKQk5K4mEko6qQQ","photo_id":"ItQ5Ne69LGRemrE8AQb3RQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ItQ5Ne69LGRemrE8AQb3RQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8423041105270386},{"business_id":"aH3xlewNKQk5K4mEko6qQQ","photo_id":"nxMiUKqVtBhor5xm6Uj9rA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nxMiUKqVtBhor5xm